      "decision_index": 30,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Liliana's Devotee (2/3) can block Ironshell Beetle (2/2) and survive while killing the attacker. This is a free favorable block that also triggers Devotee's 'creature died this turn' ability for potential zombie token creation. Instead, MiniMx timed out and took 2 unnecessary damage while leaving the opponent's creature alive.",
