    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Attempted to cast Eaten Alive without being able to pay the additional cost ({3}{B} requires 5 mana, only 3 available). Sacrificing Ghoulraiser or Liliana's Devotee to remove a 2/2 Knight would also be a poor trade. The game rolled back the action.",
