      "decision_index": 40,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Failed to declare any attackers with two vigilance creatures (Gallant Cavalry 2/2 and Knight Token 2/2). Since both have vigilance, attacking has no defensive downside — they remain untapped for blocking. The opponent would need to either take damage or make blocking decisions with Ghoulraiser and Liliana's Devotee. At minimum, attacking forces the opponent into uncomfortable choices and potentially deals 2-4 damage for free.",
      "action_taken": "Timed out and declared no attackers.",
