      "player": "Grok4F Humble",
      "decision_index": 48,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Failed to assign any blockers against two 2/2 attackers, taking 4 unnecessary damage. Liliana's Devotee (2/3) could block and kill a 2/2 while surviving, and Black Cat could chump the other (dying to trigger random discard from opponent's 2-card hand and enabling Devotee's end-step zombie token). This would result in 0 damage taken, both attackers killed, Devotee surviving, a forced discard, and a free zombie token.",
