      "decision_index": 49,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Failed to declare any attackers when the opponent had only one untapped blocker (Liliana's Devotee 2/3) and all lands tapped (no tricks possible). Attacking with all three creatures would deal 4-10 damage depending on blocks, with the vigilance creatures staying untapped for defense. The Moldgraf Millipede at 6/6 is a massive threat that demands a block, letting the two vigilance 2/2s through for guaranteed damage.",
