      "decision_index": 58,
    },
    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Failed to declare any blockers against 10 total damage (2/2 + 2/2 + 6/6). Liliana's Devotee (2/3) could safely block and kill a 2/2, and the Zombie Token (3/2) could chump-block the 6/6 Millipede. This would reduce damage taken from 10 to just 2, keeping life at 14 instead of dropping to 6. The Zombie Token dying would also trigger Devotee's end-step zombie creation. Going to 6 life with the opponent having this board is extremely dangerous.",
      "action_taken": "No blocks declared (timeout/no response), taking 10 damage to go to 6 life.",
      "better_line": "Block Gallant Cavalry (or Knight Token) with Liliana's Devotee (kills the 2/2, Devotee survives at 2/1) and block Moldgraf Millipede with the Zombie Token (prevents 6 damage, token dies triggering Devotee's ability). Take only 2 damage, going to 14 life.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 203,
      "player": "MiniMx Minimal",
      "decision_index": 59,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "MiniMx declined to attack with Liliana's Devotee (2/3) and Zombie Token (3/2) into only two 2/2 vigilance creatures. In every scenario, attacking is superior: if blocked, both MiniMx creatures survive (3 toughness and 2 toughness vs 2 power) while killing the opponent's 2/2s, reducing next turn's incoming damage. If unblocked, 5 damage pushes the opponent from 18 toward a more manageable life total. Additionally, killing creatures triggers Liliana's Devotee end-step ability for a free zombie token. Not attacking preserves the opponent's board unnecessarily when MiniMx is behind at 6 life.",
      "action_taken": "Declined to attack with any creatures.",
      "better_line": "Attack with both Liliana's Devotee and Zombie Token. They win every combat trade against the 2/2 vigilance blockers, clearing the opponent's board of those threats while MiniMx's creatures survive, and potentially triggering Devotee's end-step zombie creation.",
      "type": "blunder",
