    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Player timed out and failed to declare any attackers with a dominant board (6/6, 3/4, two 2/2 vigilance creatures) against an opponent at 6 life with only two blockers and all lands tapped. Attacking all would force at least 4-5 damage through (opponent at 1-2 life) with minimal risk, since the vigilance creatures remain untapped for defense. This gives the opponent a free turn to stabilize, use Infernal Idol to draw cards, and potentially find answers like Massacre Wurm or Yargle.",
